# Android acquisition (code, 2026-08-17)

`Phase7AndroidAgentRunner.acquire` (`bootstrap_runner.py`): device bootstrap → agent `bootstrap(policy)` → `_enumerate` → **parallel** `_preprocess` + `_select` → `DirectCrawlTransferService.ingest`. Recovery is **after** the provider, in `acquire_dispatch`.

## Inventory

11 sources must match `ANDROID_INVENTORY_SOURCES`: `public_whatsapp`, `public_telegram`, `media_store_image/video/audio`, `shared_storage_document`, `document_tree`, `sms_content_provider`, `contacts_content_provider`, `accessibility_visible_ui`, `notification_listener`.

Social automation runs **inside** `_enumerate` while `accessibility_visible_ui` is pending, **before** paging other sources. Then page remaining sources (page 100; SMS 64; UI/notif 50).

Time cut QUICK 3 months / FULL 6 months (`InventoryTimeScope`). MediaStore query is OR of `DATE_TAKEN` / `DATE_ADDED` / `DATE_MODIFIED` (nulls kept). Contacts unbounded. Notifications are the live listener buffer, not a 90-day archive. Block IG/X/FB notifications. Visible UI trees depth 16 / 256 nodes. `source_reason` ≤128. `QUICK_INVENTORY_ITEMS_PER_SOURCE=200` exists in BuildConfig and is **unused**.

## Social (`AutomationEngine` in `AutomationContract.kt`)

Targets: IG, X (`com.twitter.android`), Facebook. Fail one scope → `partial`; always `returnToAgent` then host restarts agent.

- IG VISUAL: `own_profile` → `own_posts` → `own_story_archive` → `own_comments`. Archive/comments **3 extra scrolls** (4 captures incl. initial). Posts 0 extra scrolls when count `< 3`. Parsed UI dates (`4mo`, `13 Mei`) stop posts/archive/comments; profile unwindowed. Grid scroll, never ViewPager for archive. Settings: click visible Archive / Your activity row first; Search only if ≥12s remain. Screenshots + `ocr_host_deferred`.
- X TEXT_ONLY: profile → tweets → replies. No screenshots. Reject JSON `"null"` usernames.
- FB TEXT_ONLY: profile → posts → comments (`own_story_archive` allowlisted, **not** default). `friends` is its own metric. Reject composer / clock / `Profile picture`.

Budgets: scrolls QUICK 18 / FULL 40; screenshots QUICK 24 / FULL 46 (X/FB forced 0).

## Selection + transfer

Policy `siksik-selection-v3`, threshold 5500 bp, authored on host, scored on agent. All `required_social_scopes` auto-selected. Agent does not create findings. If `review_candidates` (operator start does **not** set this): skip live ingest, wait for confirm.

Live ingest (`LiveSelectedIngestor`) during `_select` when review is off: writes canonical JSON, analyzes with status still `ACQUIRING`. Transfer then replaces staging via manifest under `/sdcard/Android/data/com.siksik.agent/files/siksik_transfer`. Host Instagram OCR in `build_social_snapshot_enrichments`.

## Recovery

QUICK+FULL: MediaStore trash + shared trash (QUICK scans Android/DCIM/Pictures/Movies/Download only). **Both** modes `recover_cache=True` (gallery-cache previews if MediaStore identity absent and JPEG/PNG/WebP valid). Manifest `_android_recovery/manifest-v1.json`; require `cache_scan_completed` before reuse. Hashed names; no raw paths/URIs/serials. Index only verified `recovered_trash/` files. Fail-soft in `acquire_dispatch`.
